{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1CH","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"歷代志上","commonName":"歷代志上","title":"歷代志上","order":13,"numberOfChapters":29,"sha256":"2f94c34a21c96afb2fa5dd31e916ecbe47a93a65b505dad02727f81d295816f4","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/1CH/1.json","lastChapterNumber":29,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/1CH/29.json","totalNumberOfVerses":938},"chapter":{"number":20,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["攻取拉巴"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["第二年春天，在列王出征的時節，約押率領軍兵去毀壞亞捫人的土地，然後圍攻拉巴，將城摧毀。當時，大衛在耶路撒冷。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["大衛奪取了亞捫王頭上的金冠。這金冠重達三十四公斤，上面還鑲著寶石，人們將它戴在大衛頭上。大衛從城裡獲得許多戰利品，"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["他把城裡的人帶出來，命他們用鋸、鐵耙和斧頭做工。他用同樣的方式對待亞捫其他城邑的居民。之後，大衛和全軍返回耶路撒冷。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["打敗非利士巨人"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["這事以後，以色列人又在基色與非利士人交戰。戶沙人西比該殺死一個叫細派的巨人後裔，非利士人被征服。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["在與非利士人的另一次交戰中，雅珥的兒子伊勒哈難殺了迦特人歌利亞的兄弟拉哈米，拉哈米的槍桿粗如織布機的軸。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["此後，在迦特又起了戰事，那裡有個身材高大的人，是巨人的後代。他每隻手和腳各有六個手指和腳趾，共二十四個手指和腳趾。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["他向以色列人罵陣，大衛的哥哥示米亞的兒子約拿單就殺了他。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["這三個迦特巨人的後裔都死在大衛和他的部下手裡。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/1CH/20.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/1CH/21.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterA